File:    models/mediapipe/pose_landmarker_lite.task
Source:  Google MediaPipe (https://developers.google.com/mediapipe)
Licence: Apache License 2.0
         https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Downloaded at setup time by scripts/setup_movement_model.py. Redistributed
under Apache 2.0, not MIT.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. Movement footage  —  NOT LICENSED, NOT CLEARED FOR REDISTRIBUTION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Any badminton video recorded for the movement-screening module, and any frame,
screenshot or annotated output derived from it, is EXCLUDED from this licence
and from redistribution entirely.

As recorded in docs/MOVEMENT_FOOTAGE_PROVENANCE.md, consent, research-use
permission and ethics clearance for this footage are NOT yet confirmed. Until
that document is completed and approved, the footage must not be redistributed,
published or included in any submission package.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. Third-party software dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Python packages (see requirements*.txt) and JavaScript packages (see
dashboard/package.json) retain their own upstream licences. They are declared
as dependencies and are not redistributed in the source package.
